#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:3
msgid "Contributions management"
msgstr "Upravljanje prispevkov"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:5
msgid ""
"Galette allows you to manage contributions sent from your members. There are "
"several types of contributions, and transactions are also proposed."
msgstr ""
"Galette vam omogoča upravljanje prispevkov, ki jih pošljejo vaši člani. "
"Obstaja več vrst prispevkov, predlagane pa so tudi transakcije."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:7
msgid ""
"A transaction? What's that? Well, a simple example is better than a long "
"text... We will use three members of a same association: Marc, Julie and "
"Zac. Each one is member, independently of which group or else they are "
"affected to, that does not matters."
msgstr ""
"Transakcija? Kaj je to? No, preprost primer je boljši kot dolgo besedilo ... "
"Uporabili bomo tri člane istega združenja: Marca, Julie in Zaca. Vsak od "
"njih je član, ne glede na to, kateri skupini pripada, sicer pa ni pomembno."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:9
msgid ""
"Zac send you a check to pay his own membership, Marc and Julie ones and also "
"a donation to the association. In this case, Zac's check will be handled in "
"a transaction attached to his account, and which will be distributed in four "
"contributions, each one attached to corresponding member."
msgstr ""
"Zac vam bo poslal ček za plačilo članarine, članarine Marca in Julie ter "
"donacijo združenju. V tem primeru bo Zacov ček obdelan v transakciji, "
"priloženi njegovemu računu, ki bo razdeljena v štiri prispevke, od katerih "
"bo vsak priložen ustreznemu članu."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:11
msgid ""
"Another example: Pierre pays his own contribution, his transaction will only "
"contains his membership and will be distributed in only one contribution."
msgstr ""
"Drug primer: Pierre plača svoj prispevek, njegova transakcija bo vsebovala "
"samo njegovo članstvo in bo razdeljena samo v enem prispevku."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:13
msgid ""
"If Pierre, Zac, Julie or Marc are late, you can send them a :ref:`reminder "
"<reminders>` :p"
msgstr ""
"Če Pierre, Zac, Julie ali Marc zamujajo, jim lahko pošljete :ref:`opomnik "
"<reminders>` :p"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:16
msgid "Contributions"
msgstr "Prispevki"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:18
msgid ""
"A contribution can be a membership, a donation, a gift, ... Galette allows "
"you to store all of that for each member."
msgstr ""
"Prispevek je lahko članarina, donacija, darilo, ... Galette vam omogoča "
"shranjevanje vsega tega za vsakega člana."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:21
msgid "Contributions types"
msgstr "Vrste prispevkov"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:23
msgid ""
"Contributions are entirely configurable. There are two main types of "
"contributions in Galette:"
msgstr ""
"Prispevke je mogoče v celoti konfigurirati. V Galette obstajata dve glavni "
"vrsti prispevkov:"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:25
msgid ""
"the ones that extends a membership (a monthly or yearly membership for "
"example),"
msgstr ""
"tiste, ki podaljšujejo članstvo (na primer mesečno ali letno članstvo),"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:26
msgid "the ones that do not extends membership, like donations."
msgstr "tiste, ki ne podaljšujejo članstva, kot so donacije."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:28
msgid ""
"Contribution types management allows you to define a label, and if it "
"extends the membership or not."
msgstr ""
"Upravljanje vrst prispevkov vam omogoča, da določite oznako in ali ta "
"podaljša članstvo ali ne."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:33
msgid "Reminders"
msgstr "Opomniki"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:35
msgid ""
"Emails models to remind due dates are available from the emails contents "
"(\"Impending due date\" and \"Late due date\")."
msgstr ""
"Modeli e-poštnih sporočil za opomnike na roke so na voljo v vsebini e-"
"poštnih sporočil (»Bližajoči se rok« in »Zamujeni rok«)."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:37
msgid ""
"The reminder button from the dashboard or the reminders entry of the menu "
"will give you access to the reminders management interface."
msgstr ""
"Gumb za opomnike na nadzorni plošči ali vnos opomnikov v meniju vam bo "
"omogočil dostop do vmesnika za upravljanje opomnikov."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:39
msgid "Reminders management interface"
msgstr "Vmesnik za upravljanje opomnikov"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:44
msgid "Two categories can be selected:"
msgstr "Izbrati je mogoče dve kategoriji:"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:46
msgid "members whose due date is close,"
msgstr "člani, katerih rok se bliža,"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:47
msgid "members whose due date is in the past."
msgstr "člani, katerih rok je v preteklosti."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:49
msgid ""
"Per default (this is currently not configurable), reminders are sent one "
"month, then seven days before the due date; and then one and two months "
"after the due date expiration. Reminders are stored in the database, if you "
"never sent any reminder, all matching members will be reminded."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto (tega trenutno ni mogoče konfigurirati) se opomniki pošljejo en "
"mesec, nato sedem dni pred rokom; in nato en in dva meseca po preteku roka. "
"Opomniki so shranjeni v zbirki podatkov; če niste nikoli poslali nobenega "
"opomnika, bodo opomnjeni vsi ustrezni člani."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:51
msgid ""
"Galette will tell you if some members do not have an email address, you can "
"print labels for those ones."
msgstr ""
"Galette vam bo povedala, da če nekateri člani nimajo e-poštnega naslova, "
"lahko zanje natisnete nalepke."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:55
msgid ""
"Reminders obey the :ref:`sending limits <mail_throttling>`, following the "
"very same rule as :ref:`mass mailings <mailing_queue>`: as long as no hourly "
"or daily quota is set, they are sent while the page loads, exactly as they "
"always were."
msgstr ""
"Opomniki upoštevajo :ref:`omejitve pošiljanja <mail_throttling>`, pri čemer "
"sledijo istemu pravilu kot :ref:`množična pošiljanja <mailing_queue>`: "
"dokler ni nastavljena urna ali dnevna kvota, se pošiljajo med nalaganjem "
"strani, natanko tako kot vedno."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:57
msgid ""
"Each reminder stays an individual message, written in the language of its "
"recipient, either way. The quota counters are shared with mass mailings."
msgstr ""
"Vsak opomnik ostane posamezno sporočilo, tako ali tako napisano v jeziku "
"prejemnika. Števci kvot so v skupni rabi z množičnimi pošiljkami."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:59
msgid ""
"Finally, it is possible to automate reminders with a cron task which will "
"call the ``galette/cron/reminder.php`` file. If you want reminders to be "
"sent every day at 8:30 AM, then you can add a ``/etc/cron.d/galette`` file "
"(on Fedora and similar, look at your system documentation to know how to add "
"a crontab) with the following content:"
msgstr ""
"Končno lahko opomnike avtomatizirate z opravilom cron, ki bo zagnalo "
"datoteko ``galette/cron/reminder.php``. Če želite, da se opomniki pošiljajo "
"vsak dan ob 8.30, lahko dodate datoteko ``/etc/cron.d/galette`` (v sistemih "
"Fedora in podobnih preverite sistemsko dokumentacijo za navodila o dodajanju "
"opravil v crontab) z naslednjo vsebino:"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:65
msgid ""
"The script queues the reminders that are due, then drains the queue itself, "
"respecting the same limits. It stays silent unless something failed, so cron "
"only writes to you when there is a reason to."
msgstr ""
"Skript postavi v čakalno vrsto opomnike, ki so zapadli, nato pa sam izprazni "
"čakalno vrsto ob upoštevanju istih omejitev. Ostane tiho, razen če kaj ne "
"uspe, zato vam cron piše le, če za to obstaja razlog."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:68
msgid "Invoices and receipts"
msgstr "Računi in potrdila"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:70
msgid ""
"In the contributions list, there is a PDF icon which is designed to generate "
"invoice ou receipt for one contribution."
msgstr ""
"Na seznamu prispevkov je ikona PDF, ki je namenjena ustvarjanju računa ali "
"potrdila za en prispevek."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:72
msgid "You can customize the PDF using :ref:`PDF models <pdf_models>`."
msgstr "PDF lahko prilagodite z uporabo :ref:`PDF models <pdf_models>`."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:75
msgid "Scheduled payments"
msgstr "Načrtovana plačila"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:79
msgid ""
"It is possible to dispatch a contribution among one or several scheduled "
"payments. All you have to do is to select \"Scheduled payment\" as payment "
"type in your contribution; Galette will propose you to create an attached "
"scheduled payment."
msgstr ""
"Prispevek je mogoče poslati med enim ali več načrtovanimi plačili. Vse, kar "
"morate storiti, je, da v svojem prispevku kot vrsto plačila izberete "
"»Načrtovano plačilo«; Galette vam bo predlagala, da ustvarite priloženo "
"načrtovano plačilo."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:81
msgid "Add scheduled payment to a contribution"
msgstr "Dodaj načrtovano plačilo prispevku"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:86
msgid ""
"By default, the entire remaining amount will be set into scheduled payment, "
"but you can enter whatever you want. You can also select any payment type "
"(except scheduled payment)."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto bo celoten preostali znesek nastavljen na načrtovano plačilo, "
"vendar lahko vnesete karkoli želite. Izberete lahko tudi katero koli vrsto "
"plačila (razen načrtovanega plačila)."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:88
msgid ""
"When you edit a contribution that already has attached scheduled payments, "
"you can see a summary, and you can also see list of entries."
msgstr ""
"Ko urejate prispevek, ki že ima priložena načrtovana plačila, si lahko "
"ogledate povzetek in seznam vnosov."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:90
msgid "Summary of scheduled payments"
msgstr "Povzetek načrtovanih plačil"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:95
msgid "List of attached scheduled payments"
msgstr "Seznam priloženih načrtovanih plačil"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:101
msgid "Transactions"
msgstr "Transakcije"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:103
msgid ""
"As seen in the example from this chapter introduction, a transaction is a "
"global payment for a member."
msgstr ""
"Kot je razvidno iz primera iz uvoda tega poglavja, je transakcija globalno "
"plačilo za člana."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:105
msgid "Only a few information are required to add a new transaction:"
msgstr "Za dodajanje nove transakcije je potrebnih le nekaj podatkov:"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:107
msgid "a description,"
msgstr "opis,"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:108
msgid "the originator,"
msgstr "izvornik,"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:109
msgid "the date (current date per default),"
msgstr "datum (trenutni datum je privzeto),"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:110
msgid "the amount."
msgstr "znesek."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:112
msgid "Transactions list"
msgstr "Seznam transakcij"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:117
msgid ""
"Each transaction is dispatched among contributions, in the limit of the "
"transaction amount. A transaction has itself no effect on members due dates."
msgstr ""
"Vsaka transakcija se razporedi med prispevke, v okviru zneska transakcije. "
"Transakcija sama po sebi nima vpliva na roke plačila članov."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:119
msgid "Add a transaction"
msgstr "Dodaj transakcijo"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:124
msgid ""
"After adding a new transaction, you will be redirected to a new contribution "
"creation. If this new contribution does not dispatch the remaining amount of "
"the transaction, galette will propose you to create another one. Per "
"default, the amount of a new contribution from a transaction will be the "
"remaining amount of the transaction."
msgstr ""
"Po dodajanju nove transakcije boste preusmerjeni na ustvarjanje novega "
"prispevka. Če ta novi prispevek ne poravna preostalega zneska transakcije, "
"vam bo galette predlagal, da ustvarite novega. Privzeto bo znesek novega "
"prispevka iz transakcije enak preostalemu znesku transakcije."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:126
msgid "Add a contribution linked to a partially dispatched transaction"
msgstr "Dodaj prispevek, povezan z delno odposlano transakcijo"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:131
msgid "Of course, it is also possible to edit a transaction:"
msgstr "Seveda je transakcijo mogoče tudi urediti:"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:133
msgid "Transaction edition"
msgstr "Transakcijska izdaja"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:138
msgid ""
"You can also attach an existing contribution instead of creating a new one."
msgstr "Namesto ustvarjanja novega prispevka lahko priložite tudi obstoječega."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:140
msgid "Add an already existing contribution to a transaction"
msgstr "Dodajanje obstoječega prispevka transakciji"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:148
msgid "Members selection"
msgstr "Izbira članov"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:152
msgid ""
"The dropdown list to choose a member is available from contributions and "
"transactions (as well as from several plugins) displays only a few members, "
"for performances reasons."
msgstr ""
"Spustni seznam za izbiro člana je na voljo med prispevki in transakcijami "
"(kot tudi iz več vtičnikov), zaradi učinkovitosti pa prikazuje le nekaj "
"članov."

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:154
msgid "Dropdown members list"
msgstr "Spustni seznam članov"

#: ../usermanual/contributions.rst:158
msgid ""
"You can display more members using arrow buttons or entering any text (this "
"will search in first name, last name and identifiers)."
msgstr ""
"Več članov lahko prikažete s puščičnimi gumbi ali z vnosom poljubnega "
"besedila (iskanje bo potekalo po imenu, priimku in identifikatorjih)."
